betterquesting.quest.RAH2M4DoTTaX5a2Sj4hRcQ.name=§9§l§nThe Cat is Out of the Box
betterquesting.quest.RAH2M4DoTTaX5a2Sj4hRcQ.desc=After many hours of grind, blood, sweat, tears, and a little bit of transcendent metal...%nYou are now finally able to solve mankind's hardest puzzle ever: clicking boxes randomly.%n%nThe §cUncertainty Resolution§r, §oa Dyson user's wet dream§r, will allow you to completely skip that annoying puzzle when you need to set some (probably many) Quantum Computers up.
betterquesting.quest.S1s9Qw2yQgGm0cKw-W1yvQ.name=§9§l§nAtto Power ICs
betterquesting.quest.S1s9Qw2yQgGm0cKw-W1yvQ.desc=You need Atto Power ICs for Dyson, UMV -> UXV transformers, UIV Energy/Dynamo Hatches, and Pico Circuits.%n%n[note]You'll need a UIV Cutting Mac- Wait what?[/note]%n%nFrom now on, your Cutting Machine is not going to cut it, §l§oliterally. §rThose giant sawblades cannot cut up wafers this complex.%n%nUsing your HILE is the next best thing, however you seem to burn most of the biological parts off of the wafer, causing you to gain less chips.%n%n[note]Perhaps we could focus these lasers with a new powerful lens.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.So7OhYd8SVO3_Jl370cogA.name=§9§l§nFluid^2 Extractor
betterquesting.quest.So7OhYd8SVO3_Jl370cogA.desc=Welcome to the BEC Line! It's recommended you read the wiki for full context on these machines: [url]https://wiki.gtnewhorizons.com/wiki/Bose-Einstein_Condensate_Line[/url]%n%nUntil now, manufacturing has been a matter of imposing order upon matter: heat it, compress it, shape it, and force its atoms into the arrangement you require. But the materials ahead of you have become too complex for such crude methods. No amount of mechanical precision can control every particle individually.%n%nAt temperatures approaching absolute zero, another possibility emerges. As a cloud of bosons loses its thermal motion, the quantum waves describing its particles spread and begin to overlap. Enough of them eventually occupy the same low energy state that the cloud ceases to behave like a collection of independent particles. Instead, it acts as a single coherent quantum system: a Bose-Einstein condensate.%n%nThe first step is using the §5§lEntanglement Apparatus§r to convert ordinary fluids into entangled condensate by brute-forcing this delicate state on an industrial scale. It cannot overclock; instead, it expands the experiment across unlimited parallels, processing as much material as the supplied power can sustain. Multi-amp and laser energy hatches will be necessary if you intend to feed the rest of the BEC Line at any meaningful rate.%n%nDifferent fluids may be entangled simultaneously, although the entire batch runs for the duration of the slowest active conversion.%n%n[note]Insert ordinary fluids through the input hatch at the front. Entangled condensate leaves through the BEC Hatch at the rear and is pushed into the connected Containment Field network.[/note]%n%n[note]The Apparatus does not check whether sufficient storage is available before processing. Use a BEC Detector Hatch to disable it before your Containment Fields overflow and begin voiding condensate.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.SoOmxNJvRcqY-ofFsWbyoQ.name=§9§l§nGetting More Out of Your Hypogen
betterquesting.quest.SoOmxNJvRcqY-ofFsWbyoQ.desc=Once you get your first Hypogen from Fusion, you can easily duplicate it in your DTPF.%n%nIt is a loop, though, so be cautious.
betterquesting.quest.U12vBo4fQjOyzJ67qH7gUA.name=§9§l§nNo, it's not a Typo
betterquesting.quest.U12vBo4fQjOyzJ67qH7gUA.desc=Stabilizing the neutron star of the Godforge was successful, but now you need something new to extract the power out of it into something usable. Your experiments lead you to using the newly discovered Mellion with a Transcendent Metal Nanite to create what seems like a crystal seed of some type, which exhibits perfect thermal conductance.%n%nProcessing this seed further into a solution, you realize you can grow this crystal into a slurry-like solution, which you decide to name [note]Phonon Transfer Medium[/note]. This incredible material displays exactly the properties you were looking for, and decide that now you can move forward with the second module of the Godforge.
betterquesting.quest.UIg8uIZxS8K_JVlg7eZR9g.name=§9§l§nT2 Exo-Foundry
betterquesting.quest.UIg8uIZxS8K_JVlg7eZR9g.desc=Now that you've unlocked the BHC & started Creon / Mellion production you can finally upgrade your §nExo-Foundry§r!%n%nThese §6§lEternal Magnetic Chassis§r will allow your Foundry to have a maximum of three modules.%n%n[note]Check out the Wiki if you need ideas on which modules to choose [url]https://wiki.gtnewhorizons.com/wiki/Exo-Foundry[/url][/note]
betterquesting.quest.WJ-SykCeTr2B-3SHz0mXZg.name=§9§l§nAssembling on Steroids
betterquesting.quest.WJ-SykCeTr2B-3SHz0mXZg.desc=It has 16 parallels and can utilize advanced superconductors for improved yields in optical part recipes.%n%n[note]You can't create the Ultimate Battery in one step yet-that's much further down the line.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.WLuCkspyTZqFuqlVVxgyzQ.name=§9§l§nCrayon and Melon
betterquesting.quest.WLuCkspyTZqFuqlVVxgyzQ.desc=The Godforge will require new materials with the correct properties to stabilize a neutron star. With your new Transcendent Plasma Mixer and MK5 Fusion Reactor, you learn of a new material which may be suitable, which you name [note]Creon[/note].%n%nThis material is made as a plasma, and must be cooled alongside an extremely sturdy material. You try a curious mixture of dusts, which you decide to name [note]Mellion[/note].%n%n[note]These materials may also be suitable for components you need many of, you may realize UIV components seem to handle these two materials quite well...[/note]
betterquesting.quest._U63kXS8QNqZZCgZSYYrKw.name=§9§l§nPrimitive Components
betterquesting.quest._U63kXS8QNqZZCgZSYYrKw.desc=Condensate is no joke; that stuff can mess you up big time. Your puny Assembly Lines do not meet the requirements to assemble with it.%n%nPrimitive Components allow you to assemble complex parts using condensate at much better prices.
betterquesting.quest.cmR_3Et6RMyXYfHzRf3Qjg.name=§9§l§nSisters In Arms
betterquesting.quest.cmR_3Et6RMyXYfHzRf3Qjg.desc=Tairitsu, Shijima, and Churitsu are sister materials, all requiring similarly colored materials to make. A hidden connection among them allows powerful protective forces to appear.%n%nTry putting their bond to good use.%n%n[note]Technetium dust is needed for Shijima. It can be produced by fusing Fluorine and Selenium. The latter can be obtained through the Selenium line, by processing Platinum Froth, or from Miessite in the Toxic Everglades.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.fnDuNiloR6iXAea0Lhjgtg.name=§9§l§nUIV Energy Hatch
betterquesting.quest.fnDuNiloR6iXAea0Lhjgtg.desc=Woah, another Energy Hatch.%n%nYou should probably consider upgrading your Assembly Lines and Precise Assemblers first.
betterquesting.quest.g0oiNbRuQpWrzFOS8l-DtA.name=§9§l§nAn Even More Mega EBF
betterquesting.quest.g0oiNbRuQpWrzFOS8l-DtA.desc=With the project finally completed, and a new material capable of harnessing the power of a neutron star, you decide the natural first application of this immense power could be used for a far superior Blast Furnace. With a little tinkering, you decide a second may be necessary, since this module could easily be retrofitted into an ordinary Furnace as well.%n%n[note]The first module of the Godforge, Helioflare Power Forge can perform EBF recipes and Furnace recipes in separate running modes, toggleable in the UI. Note that the Furnace mode does NOT contribute towards the Conversion milestone![/note]%n%n[note]Usage of this module requires the START upgrade.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.j4pFVWCCSBGZsTyI7wpCYA.name=§9§l§nEnergised Tesseract
betterquesting.quest.j4pFVWCCSBGZsTyI7wpCYA.desc=Using high amounts of energy and the strange properties of a Quantum Anomaly, Tesseracts can become energised, unlocking hidden potential.%n%n[note]You better love crafting these...[/note]
betterquesting.quest.jSgzKTJOTiSm6ArYis30dg.name=§9§l§nEternal Coil Upgrade
betterquesting.quest.jSgzKTJOTiSm6ArYis30dg.desc=Beyond spacetime, beyond reality. You have peered into what never existed and brought it first into a fluid, then into a solid. It has been stabilized against all odds. When you look at it, you feel as though you could hold the entire universe in your hand.%n%nIn the past, you were able to combine almost all materials into one through an Eternal Singularity, an infinitely dense sample of the universe. However, automating this at the scale of the DTPF proved ridiculous and would have stopped your progress altogether if not for the discovery of the Energised Tesseract. To physically manifest spacetime itself, you first needed to manifest the fourth spatial dimension. That is what the Tesseract is: a 4-dimensional cube.%n%nCubes! Almost everything around you is made of cubes. You have only glimpsed the reality of the 4-dimensional world, but you have successfully used it to condense spacetime, which can be arbitrarily molded into the complete Eternal mixture. Needless to say, living circuits will not suffice to maintain an infinitely dense, infinitely stable, multidimensional material.%n%nThe Eternal Coil is currently the final upgrade, reaching 13,501 K. This really makes your DTPF shine!
betterquesting.quest.kvqtI5rrRrOhi5jhPR-s4A.name=§9§l§nUIV Superconductors
betterquesting.quest.kvqtI5rrRrOhi5jhPR-s4A.desc=Didn't expect the Rhugnor, did you?%n%nAs usual, mix your exotic dusts, blast them, form into wires, and superconduct.
betterquesting.quest.mr9r3y_kQbWxO2Gm_RvEIg.name=§9§l§nHeliothermal Plasma Fabricator
betterquesting.quest.mr9r3y_kQbWxO2Gm_RvEIg.desc=As understanding of graviton shards continues to improve, better control over the materials they manipulate can be achieved. Graviton shards provide an alternative to electromagnetic containment of plasma using spacetime manipulation instead, allowing the Forge to directly output processed materials as plasma.%n%n[note]The third module of the Godforge, Heliothermal Plasma Fabricator can directly convert materials into their plasma form, at the cost of an immense amount of power. This may not be ideal for every plasma, but can save a lot of time on particularly slow ones. Additionally, later upgrades allow the creation of exotic plasmas which cannot be created through other means.[/note]%n%n[note]Usage of this module requires the GPCI upgrade.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.n2AqI9hGSEegVf6hfygemQ.desc=With your research now complete, you have finally constructed it - the Forge of the Gods.%n%nThe Forge of the Gods is an immensely powerful structure constructed around a stabilized neutron star - it is so advanced that its full capabilities are not yet understood. However, through continued use, one can slowly upgrade and expand the range of abilities of the Forge, and learn the power hidden in the most extreme parts of the universe: [note]Graviton Shards[/note].%n%nThis esoteric material can only be found where conventional matter and degenerate neutronium crust matter on the surface of a neutron star meet. At this point in space, gravitons are far more common and irradiate this material mixture to create highly unstable graviton shards, which can be used to internally upgrade the Forge. While these shards cannot yet exist outside the extreme conditions of the Forge, with continued research and utilization it may be possible to eventually isolate and extract them outside the Forge - but for what purpose?%n%n[note]Click on the logo in the UI to read more on how to operate the Godforge.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.nghPgh6-TuSKXUlzGXGrpw.name=§9§l§nSpace Modules Galore
betterquesting.quest.nghPgh6-TuSKXUlzGXGrpw.desc=Better modules will require a more advanced Space Elevator motor to function.%n%nThis upgrade will allow you to access T9 planets as well as 15 module slots on your Space Elevator. If you haven't built the expansion yet, now might be a good time.%n%n[note]You can enable the Space Elevator expansion in the GUI.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.pW_B3nmQTxy87apiA9DyMA.name=§9§l§nSpacetime Splitting
betterquesting.quest.pW_B3nmQTxy87apiA9DyMA.desc=Spacetime... separates?? Crazy world we're living in.%n%nYou will need a lot of both of these for future crafts throughout the rest of the game, so make sure to set up infrastructure that can handle the demand. Luckily for you, you only need a small amount of it for now.%n%nYou will eventually be able to use DTPF and QFT recipes to speed the process up significantly, but for now the Spinmatron should be able to handle production just fine.%n%n[note]In addition to being a crafting ingredient, these can later be used to boost the performance of certain multiblocks, like the LNR, SSASS, & Vacuum Freezer.[/note]%n%n[note]To craft these fluids before UMV energy hatches, overclock the Spinmatron with a high power UIV Laser Hatch%n%nNote, Heavy Mode uses a lot of power.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.q5Gvvfe5Tm2gxZfi7VIgpg.name=§9§l§nYour First SpaceTime
betterquesting.quest.q5Gvvfe5Tm2gxZfi7VIgpg.desc=[note]§lHurrah, you can finally move on to the UMV tier!§r[/note]%n%nThe residue produced from the DTPFs seems to have an interesting interaction with reality, as if it bends the universe to its will.%n%nWhat if you combined it with some infinity and hypogen to excite it, and an energized tesseract as a way to fling it back and forth to the 4th Dimension?%n%nMaybe then you could achieve the unachievable, a building block of the entire universe.%n%nThe base recipe is horrible, so definitely make the Eternal Coils for your DTPF first.%n%n&g&#008CFF&#FF00E5Congrats on making it this far!§r%n%n[note]P.S. Spacetime can be used as a substitute in all superconductor crafts and cut down on craft times substantially.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.q6WN7XY8Qf6PNgWTy7RrBA.name=§9§l§nUIV Field Generator
betterquesting.quest.q6WN7XY8Qf6PNgWTy7RrBA.desc=A bit expensive, but worth the QoL items you can craft with it.
betterquesting.quest.u-1Y-eQ-TLyw-WGi5EEnVA.name=§9§l§nTier 11 (UIV)
betterquesting.quest.u-1Y-eQ-TLyw-WGi5EEnVA.desc=Now that you've enjoyed your exotic cookies, let's keep going, shall we?%n%nWelcome to Insanely Ultimate Voltage, a very fun tier with many new large multiblocks to play with! At first, this tier is mainly about solving your DTPF catalyst problems and getting to Eternal Coils. Afterward, you are introduced to late game content like the Forge of the Gods, the Bose-Einstein Condensate Apparatus, and the Black Hole Compressor that you will use until the end of the modpack!%n%nThis tier also introduces a few QoL additions, like the Crafting Input Proxy, Uncertainty Resolver, and the Thaumometric Essentia Cell.%n%nYou also gain access to the Dyson Swarm and the Semi-Stable Antimatter Stabilization Sequencer, two incredibly powerful ways to generate power.
betterquesting.quest.vLnSpTweSki3BaorBNQhxQ.name=§9§l§nFuwusion MK5
betterquesting.quest.vLnSpTweSki3BaorBNQhxQ.desc=After seeing how slow Shirabon is to make, you might want to upgrade your Fusion setup.%n%nLike its predecessor, the MK4, this version also supports 4/4 OC. Hopefully, this will make your Metastable Oganesson issues a bit more manageable.%n%n[note]You can specify the batch amount in the GUI if you don't want it to handle one-tick recipes.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.yySGZ5RzSZm38ElTS1kL7g.name=§9§l§nMaybe I Do Need These
betterquesting.quest.yySGZ5RzSZm38ElTS1kL7g.desc=Once upon a time, these were optional and commonly skipped. Now that UMV CoAL is gated behind BEC, however, it may be worth making a set for cheaper UIV components.%n%nYou will also need 20 of them to craft Quantum Circuits in the NAC at UMV.%n%n...or you could just make extra UMV ones.%n%n[note]The UIV CoAL requires Superdense Transcendent Metal Plates, which can only be crafted in the BHC.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.-fvTafFJRo67bYWh46USSw.name=§c§l§nT4: Advanced
betterquesting.quest.-fvTafFJRo67bYWh46USSw.desc=The §3Advanced§r Spacetime Compression Field Generator allows for up to §lT4§r recipes which produce §l1152L§r of Black Dwarf Matter per successful batch.%n%nThe §3Advanced§r Time Dilation Field Generator grants a §287.5%%§r time reduction for any recipe ran in the EoH, but reduces the likelihood of success by §c27.75%%§r.%n%nThe §3Advanced§r Stabilisation Field Generator will boost the success chance of the EoH by §215%%§r, but will decrease the yield by §c15%%§r and increase the power cost by §c25%%§r.
betterquesting.quest.21tDEYptRuOgSJym30Watg.name=§c§l§nFinally, Universium!
betterquesting.quest.21tDEYptRuOgSJym30Watg.desc=You've finally solved it. Who knew that leaving dead stars long enough would cause your artificial solar system to implode and lead to a Big Bang?%n%nIf only you could tap into that much mass right before it started expanding again, you could literally hold the entire universe in the palm of your hand.%n%nThis is your third and final material from the EOH.%n%n[note]It's mainly used for UXV crafts, but your first few should go in the Eternity loop. The quest for it is located in the Endgame Goals tab.%n%nCongrats! You can now craft Magnetohydrodynamically Constrained Star Matter (MHDCSM).[/note]
betterquesting.quest.2TXAUm6oQ0OhtMK79tC5cw.name=§c§l§nWireless Multi-Amp Hatches
betterquesting.quest.2TXAUm6oQ0OhtMK79tC5cw.desc=With Shirabon now acquired, you can create 4A, 16A and 64A wireless energy hatches. These are particularly useful for machines which can use multi-amp, but do not need extreme amounts of power warranting a laser hatch.%n%n[note]These used to be needed in large quantities, being the best energy hatch to use on a Processing Array. May they rest in peace.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.52Yelo6KSLGumzXo-_F5DQ.name=§c§l§nMagnetohydrodynamically Constrained Star Matter
betterquesting.quest.52Yelo6KSLGumzXo-_F5DQ.desc=Or MHDCSM for short.%n%nThis is your primary material for UXV components. It's tricky to make and extremely expensive, as all endgame materials should be.%n%nInstead of solidifying it directly, you need to coat Eternity parts with it.%n%nHave fun!
betterquesting.quest.5vAyoCzxQkSRpjzlDNwtrw.name=§c§l§nGuzzling Massive Amounts of Gas
betterquesting.quest.5vAyoCzxQkSRpjzlDNwtrw.desc=It can run 4 different recipes simultaneously, with 4 parallels for each recipe.%n%nA worthy upgrade for some SpaceTime.
betterquesting.quest.6rzcSbH2QY2cpChT2zLC_g.name=§c§l§nUMV Energy Hatch
betterquesting.quest.6rzcSbH2QY2cpChT2zLC_g.desc=The penultimate energy hatch.%n%nHopefully you know what to upgrade first.%n%n[note]Have you checked out wireless energy hatches yet?[/note]
betterquesting.quest.7oSbFvGZQfydqvXrYqLACA.name=§c§l§nZepto Power IC
betterquesting.quest.7oSbFvGZQfydqvXrYqLACA.desc=You need Zepto Power ICs for UXV -> MAX transformers, UMV Energy/Dynamos Hatches, and Quantum Circuits.%n%nThese wafers will need to be crafted in a Beam Crafter with Spacetime Dust and Molten Creon and Mellion. Perhaps upgrade your LHC some more.%n%n[note]You'll need a UMV Laser Engraver, or an OC'd multi to actually cut the wafers.%n%nWho isn't using OC'd multis at this point?[/note]
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMoQ.desc=Go no further if you value your sanity.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMqw.name=§c§l§nNot Quite There Yet
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMqw.desc=Just a bit more.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMrA.name=§c§l§nUXV Circuits
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMrA.desc=Quantum Circuits, another upgrade of Optical Mainframes and Pico Circuits. These UXV circuits will be required for lots of future crafts.%n%n[note]You will need your Pico Circuit NAC to get started.%n%nDid you know all special circuits contribute to the calibration?[/note]%n%n[warn]Rumor has it these circuits may not be around for much longer... %n%nMaybe do not trust rumors...[/warn]
betterquesting.quest.C0erucWORuCA_neG7VCkvg.name=§c§l§nWhat is this, Tekxit?
betterquesting.quest.C0erucWORuCA_neG7VCkvg.desc=The immense heat of the God Forge and its modules allow for ideas themselves to be melted down.%n%nTwo clashing ideologies, forced to coexist. §3Hexanite§r is born.%n%nA fusion of §dMagic§r and §6Technology§f§r, the ultimate concoction, a volatile one. Even the God Forge struggles to merge them perfectly. A mess of ideas needs a host, something familiar to bind them together.%n%n§3§r[note]Redstone Plasma requires the God Forge to be melted, while Ichorium only needs a Fluid Extractor. You are sure to have lots of Ichorium Dust lying around from your Space Miners.%n%nIt is recommended to cast these materials in an Exo-Foundry, as the long wait times and high volume of use cannot be supported in a Mass Solidifier[/note]
betterquesting.quest.DVLahVNUQ-CvjYwmvkUn-Q.desc=Who knew that creating artificial solar systems would finally allow you to extract the core of a freshly dead star?%n%nWith your current crude casings, you can only accelerate the life of an artificial solar system to observe white dwarfs.%n%nPerhaps this matter will help you push the process even further.%n%n[note]This is one of the three EOH materials. Use it to upgrade your casings up to T4.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.HFpuUdRKS--dsQzGEvjW2w.name=§c§l§nT6: Exotic
betterquesting.quest.HFpuUdRKS--dsQzGEvjW2w.desc=The §eExotic§r§r Spacetime Compression Field Generator allows for up to §lT6§r recipes which produce §l18432L§r of Black Dwarf Matter per successful batch.%n%nThe §eExotic§r Time Dilation Field Generator grants a §296.875%%§r time reduction for any recipe ran in the EoH, but reduces the likelihood of success by §c46.25%%§r.%n%nThe §eExotic§r Stabilisation Field Generator will boost the success chance of the EoH by §225%%§r, but will decrease the yield by §c25%%§r and increase the power cost by §c15%%§r.
betterquesting.quest.Hgj4aBbmQUCkp325rL-McQ.name=§c§l§nT3: Stable
betterquesting.quest.Hgj4aBbmQUCkp325rL-McQ.desc=The §9Stable§r Spacetime Compression Field Generator allows for up to §lT3§r recipes which produce §l18432L§r of White Dwarf Matter per successful batch.%n%nThe §9Stable§r Time Dilation Field Generator grants a §275%%§r time reduction for any recipe ran in the EoH, but reduces the likelihood of success by §c18.5%%§r.%n%nThe §9Stable§r Stabilisation Field Generator will boost the success chance of the EoH by §210%%§r, but will decrease the yield by §c10%%§r and increase the power cost by §c30%%§r.
betterquesting.quest.LxgRRQ25SE2IQOCMxZa8ug.name=§c§l§nResplendent Components
betterquesting.quest.LxgRRQ25SE2IQOCMxZa8ug.desc=Even Refined Components begin to fail near the final tiers of the EoH. Only something far greater than stellar matter will suffice.%n%nBy incorporating MHDCSM into their structure, Resplendent Components can withstand the most extreme conditions your EoH can create.
betterquesting.quest.MiGXZ65sRwiAdpsCrVB0Eg.name=§c§l§nYet Another Space Elevator Upgrade
betterquesting.quest.MiGXZ65sRwiAdpsCrVB0Eg.desc=This bad boi can handle 18 modules at once.
betterquesting.quest.QO1gudFvTtKgWe9942dW3Q.name=§c§l§nStars, So Many Stars
betterquesting.quest.QO1gudFvTtKgWe9942dW3Q.desc=Eternal coils? Perfect time for stargate trophy number three.%nYou know the drill, you give 2 stargates' worth of stuff, you get your trophy. Simple as that.%n%n[note]Our journey through time continues onwards, entering the UMV, aka DTPF era.%n%nSurprisingly, it still is the year 2022, but there have been a huge amount of changes since our last stop in the UEV era. The DTPF exists now, hypogen & eternal coils included, and machine parts up to UMV thus are craftable. Wireless energy is a thing now too, both the LSC and the regular hatch kind, and AE2FC is in the pack, allowing direct fluid crafting (meaning no more volumetric flask shuffling).%nThe power situation hasn't changed much since the UEV era, except for dyson being even more bugged and giving free uncapped infinite power (abusing this was obviously labeled as bugabuse).%nSome other new useful things are the MABS, Integrated Ore Factory, Space Elevator, UIV and UMV singleblocks, EIG, EEC, industrial & mega apiary, yottanks, stocking buses, data bank chaining and the Draconic Fusion Crafter.%nThe stargate's cost has now skyrocketed far more than ever before, marking the beginning of this new era of GT:NH endgame, the era of expansion.%n%nThis time around the leading §aGDCloud§r was challenged by the team §aNeo Caelestia§r, who were progressing at a staggering speed, inching ever closer to being first to gate, but ultimately weren't able to fully catch up and thus §aGDCloud§r once again was first to conquer the challenge on the §a19th of November, 2022§r.%n%nP.S.: You know how this works, right? Here's the list:%n-PCB Factory, Component Assemblyline, AAL, Transcendent Plasma Mixer, EOH, QFT%n-Multi-Amp wireless hatches%n-Sub 1-tick OC, Batch Mode, inbuilt Void Protection on multis%n-Level Maintainer, Stocking Hatches, Crafting Input Buses%n%nP.P.S.: Chaotic capacitor bank? What's that?[/note]
betterquesting.quest.Qjg1J4kuS-6937dCEUqHUw.name=§c§l§nA Second Ring has Hit the Godforge
betterquesting.quest.Qjg1J4kuS-6937dCEUqHUw.desc=As additional rings are placed closer to the star at the center of the Forge, the gravitational stress drastically increases on the structure. Graviton shards alleviate these stresses while also creating localized spacetime bridges to link the two rings and their modules' respective upgrades.%n%n[note]Adding a second ring to your Godforge allows for 4 additional modules, as well as allowing you to pick a second path in the split paths part of the upgrade tree.[/note]%n%n[note]Usage of a second ring requires the CD upgrade.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.RTzMnAU8SvC0mzrDPHDbPg.name=§c§l§nReinforced Components
betterquesting.quest.RTzMnAU8SvC0mzrDPHDbPg.desc=Primitive Components are no longer strong enough to make the parts needed for a better EoH. Time for an upgrade!%n%nBy incorporating White Dwarf Matter into their structure, Reinforced Components can maintain their shape beneath far stronger spacetime compression fields.
betterquesting.quest.U7Ta5d7PSii76sbIPbltlw.name=§c§l§nMagnetic Monopole Matter
betterquesting.quest.U7Ta5d7PSii76sbIPbltlw.desc=With total mastery of the Forge of the Gods achieved, it is possible to begin a new universe-spanning initiative. It is now possible to quantize and extract graviton shards for use outside the Forge in powerful new technological endeavors; produce the most exotic plasmas beyond merely periodic elements; and most importantly, begin to understand the immense power of magmatter, a form of matter made entirely of magnetic monopoles with density and stability billions of times that of conventional bosonic matter. It is with this development you realize that the completion of the Forge was not the end goal, but merely a stepping stone to universal transcendence.%n%n[note]Required for UXV components, Magmatter is the second material the Heliofusion Exoticizer can create, and will require a second module. Read the Godforge Information in the UI for more information on how to automate this.[/note]%n%n[note]The creation of Magmatter requires the EE upgrade.[/note]%n%n[note]Congrats! You can now move on to the UXV tier![/note]
betterquesting.quest.VYn4yi1TSiqJRhtK8YOjjQ.name=§c§l§nPerfected Components
betterquesting.quest.VYn4yi1TSiqJRhtK8YOjjQ.desc=Your EoH may not need anything beyond Resplendent Components, but the rest of your factory soon will.%n%nPerfected Components require exceptionally expensive materials, including Magmatter. You do not need them immediately, but future UXV CoAL Casings, Astral Arrays, and Stargate parts will demand plenty.
betterquesting.quest.XoEzTtuPQjyeHTyqp9eY8Q.name=§c§l§nConvergence
betterquesting.quest.XoEzTtuPQjyeHTyqp9eY8Q.desc=Running your Dimensionally Transcendent Plasma Forge for an extended period [note](8 hours)[/note] allows the Multidimensional Spaces to align perfectly.%n%nWith your newly acquired technology, you can now tap into these spaces in perfect sync, enabling your plasma forges to operate at incredible speeds.%n%nThe Transdimensional Alignment Matrix allows the DTPF to run with Perfect Overclocks. To achieve this, you need a full discount, and the extra power cost is offset by using more of the same catalyst.%n%nOverall, it is more efficient and totally worth it.%n%nThis process is extremely catalyst-hungry. Ensure you're producing enough to sustain it.%n%nFor recipes without a catalyst, you must specify the catalyst in the GUI by right-clicking the Convergence button, otherwise it will default to Crude.[/note]%n%n[note]Math for the curious:%n%nTo clear up what exactly happens in the background, here's an explanation on how the extra catalyst values are calculated using an example:%n%nThe example recipe of choice is the molten neutronium recipe using prosaic catalyst, running at 64A UMV (8,589,934,592 EU/t).%nThe recipe uses 14,753L of Prosaic catalyst and 36,484,545,600 EU per recipe without OCs or the catalyst discount. With the discount, the catalyst amount gets cut in half, meaning 7,376.5L of catalyst, which are rounded to 7,376L, and due to the 64A UMV the machine is supplied with the recipe overclocks 3 times, meaning each recipe actually uses 36,484,545,600 * 2^3 = 291,876,364,800 EU.%n%nKnowing the amount of OCs and the base voltage of the recipe, the difference of the needed EU per recipe with and without perfect OC can be calculated, that being 291,876,364,800 - 36,484,545,600 = 255,391,819,200 extra EU due to imperfect OCs.%nTo get the value of needed extra catalyst, this extra EU value has to be divided by the energy density of the relevant catalyst, prosaic in this case.%n%nThe division equates to 255,391,819,200 EU / 66,768,460 EU/L = 3,825.037 L, rounded to 3,825L extra prosaic catalyst per recipe. For the final step, this value has to be multiplied by 0.5 as it's affected by the discount, meaning the total extra catalyst that gets added to the recipe is 3,825L * 0.5 = 1,912.5 L, rounded to 1,912L.%n%nTo summarize it all in a formula:%nAmount extra catalyst per recipe = (B * ((2^x) - 1))/2L%nwhere:%nB is base total EU of the recipe%nx is the number of overclocks%nL is the EU/L of the relevant catalyst [/note]
betterquesting.quest.bKW2YJfES6yvbes8JQRb0g.name=§c§l§nT7: Perfect
betterquesting.quest.bKW2YJfES6yvbes8JQRb0g.desc=The §6Perfect§r Spacetime Compression Field Generator allows for up to §lT7§r recipes which produce §l1152L§r of §5Universium§r per successful batch.%n%nThe §6Perfect§r Time Dilation Field Generator grants a §298.4375%%§r time reduction for any recipe ran in the EoH, but reduces the likelihood of success by §c55.5%%§r.%n%nThe §6Perfect§r Stabilisation Field Generator will boost the success chance of the EoH by §230%%§r, but will decrease the yield by §c30%%§r and increase the power cost by §c10%%§r.
betterquesting.quest.bPYTUdlkSCiRi0eDHHw7tw.desc=Reinforcing your casings with matter from white dwarfs was a good idea.%n%nYou can now accelerate a solar system until a black dwarf forms. This material will likely be key to observing and understanding what happens next.%n%nThis is the second of your three EOH materials. Use it to upgrade your casings to T7.%n%n[note]The EOH becomes power positive once all the casings are Tier 7.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.cEX6SRxLTnSHOyvKPkBybw.name=§c§l§nA Solder Singularity
betterquesting.quest.cEX6SRxLTnSHOyvKPkBybw.desc=Mutated Living Solder has become far too weak for your assembly needs. You need something more... cosmic.%n%nBoundless Cosmic Solder is the final tier of soldering alloy, and you will need it in large quantities.%n%n[note]Hopefully your Beamcrafter can keep up...[/note]
betterquesting.quest.cO67NYK2QsyDlcvFGkk43A.name=§c§l§nT2: Primitive
betterquesting.quest.cO67NYK2QsyDlcvFGkk43A.desc=The §dPrimitive§r Spacetime Compression Field Generator allows for up to §lT2§r recipes which produce §l4608L§r of White Dwarf Matter per successful batch.%n%nThe §dPrimitive§r Time Dilation Field Generator grants a §250%%§r time reduction for any recipe ran in the EoH, but reduces the likelihood of success by §c9.25%%§r.%n%nThe §dPrimitive§r Stabilisation Field Generator will boost the success chance of the EoH by §25%%§r, but will decrease the yield by §c5%%§r and increase the power cost by §c35%%§r.
betterquesting.quest.fj2VzJf2Rgev7uY-h3CkJQ.name=§c§l§nStellar Catalyst
betterquesting.quest.fj2VzJf2Rgev7uY-h3CkJQ.desc=Your attempts to improve your dimensional catalyst have been futile so far, but with the Raw Stellar Plasma from your Eye of Harmony, you can finally create a stable and more powerful catalyst.%n%nYou will need some higher-tier plasmas to help maintain its stability as well.%n%n[warn]Handle with care. We are not responsible for your base turning into supermassive black holes. /s[/warn]
betterquesting.quest.g5CfYPLATaiRyVInsqn9_w.name=§c§l§nT9: Gallifreyan
betterquesting.quest.g5CfYPLATaiRyVInsqn9_w.desc=The §cG§6a§el§al§bi§9f§dr§ce§6y§ea§an§r Spacetime Compression Field Generator allows for up to §lT10§r§r recipes which produce §l18432L§r of Universium per successful batch.%n%nThe §cG§6a§el§al§bi§9f§dr§ce§6y§ea§an§r Time Dilation Field Generator grants a §299.609375%%§r time reduction for any recipe ran in the EoH, but reduces the likelihood of success by §c74%%§r.%n%nThe §cG§6a§el§al§bi§9f§dr§ce§6y§ea§an§r Stabilisation Field Generator will boost the success chance of the EoH by §240%%§r, but will decrease the yield by §c40%%§r.%n%n[note]If you want to run a T10 EoH that is power positive, the best setup to use is a T9/T8/T9 (Using Tipler Time Dilation Field Generators).[/note]
betterquesting.quest.hWXZi-whQfmgWO0EII7g2g.name=§c§l§nSaving on SpaceTime
betterquesting.quest.hWXZi-whQfmgWO0EII7g2g.desc=SpaceTime is quite a challenge, isn't it? You should definitely consider upgrading your Component Assembly Lines to save on some of it.%n%n[note]Did you know you can wall-share the component casings? Just turn one CoAL upside down.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.hybMIjq9Q9mxxWKEE8gBWQ.name=§c§l§nSubspace Cooling
betterquesting.quest.hybMIjq9Q9mxxWKEE8gBWQ.desc=Cooling exotic ingots proves to be a much bigger challenge than smelting them.%n%nFortunately, reinforcing some of the casings with your new materials allows you to inject exotic coolants that capture extreme heat in miniature tears of spacetime, helping to cool your ingots a bit faster.%n%nWith Subspace Cooling, you can enable the Vacuum Freezer to achieve Perfect Overclocks… at a cost.%n%nTier 1 will consume Infinity in liquid form at [warn]20 L/s[/warn] and allow for 1 Perfect Overclock. If you have the means to provide [warn]20 L/s[/warn] of Spacetime, you can jump right to Tier 2 for 2 Perfect overclocks.%n%n[note]This cost is static, remaining the same for each recipe being run. So, be selective about cooling your ingots.%n%nThe faster the recipes, the more efficient the cost, so find your optimal balance.[/note]%n%nThe Infinity Cooled Casings replace the frost proof casings, so you don't need to worry about damaging your setups.
betterquesting.quest.jlXvqqgIQ_Crha2tW0gEQg.name=§c§l§nTier 12 (UMV)
betterquesting.quest.jlXvqqgIQ_Crha2tW0gEQg.desc=Welcome to the current penultimate tier of New Horizons, Mega Ultimate Voltage.%n%nThis tier is the tier for upgrading everything and provides access to better parts to help you scale up.%n%nGood Luck.%n%n[warn]This tier is not fully complete. Expect stuff to change.[/warn]
betterquesting.quest.k0ryGOkkSBOgYUcVY-J4rw.name=§c§l§nThe SUCC
betterquesting.quest.k0ryGOkkSBOgYUcVY-J4rw.desc=Like its predecessor it can run 4 different recipes at once, but this time each recipe has 64 parallels.%n%nA good solution for your Hydrogen and Helium problems.%n%n[note]This also requires Eternity to craft.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.kazCPEWoSmiZhR4bkHlEBQ.name=§c§l§nAn Eye at the End of Time
betterquesting.quest.kazCPEWoSmiZhR4bkHlEBQ.desc=So you have made yourself an Eternal DTPF or hopefully a few, and now it is time for the push to the next tier, UXV.%n%nIntroducing the final multiblock in the game, and by far the most expensive.%nIt introduces 4 new materials: Raw Stellar Plasma, White and Black Dwarf Matter and finally Universium.%n%nIt has 3 different tiered casings with 9 tiers each:%n%nSpacetime Compression Field Generator:%n- Determines the tier of the planet block that can be run and decreases the processing time by 3%% per tier.%n%nTime Dilation Field Generator:%n- Decreases recipe time by 50%% per tier, while decreasing the chance of a recipe succeeding by 9.25%% per tier.%n%nStabilisation Field Generator:%n- Increases the chance of a recipe succeeding by 5%% per tier, while decreasing the output of a recipe by 5%% per tier.%n%nLower tier Stabilization Field Generators have a power output penalty.%n%nFinding the best setup of different casing tiers might be a hard task, so use this calculator to evaluate setups and visualize drops: [url]https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1FTFdfmY_UWbTbFOyNzARKeI90pbHvPBH6M3JHJmaC-E/edit?usp=sharing[/url]%n%n[note]Be sure to read the tooltip of the Eye of Harmony controller, it explains everything in detail! Depending on your GUI scale it might have multiple pages.[/note]%n%n[note]Well... it explains mostly everything. The Eye of Harmony has an inbuilt pity system to make sure you don't lose your mind. Here's a quick rundown on how it operates:%n%n(All chances are decimals here)%nThere is a counter C that starts at the current recipe success chance P. If a recipe fails, (1-P)*P is added to C. If C reaches >= 1, the next roll is guaranteed to succeed and C resets to P. %nIf a recipe succeeds before C reaches >= 1, it resets in a similar manner.%nIf you switch recipes, C will be reset to P of the new recipe, even if the next roll would be a guarantee.%nThe guarantee can be canceled out by overflow penalties as they apply after the pity does. However, they do not reset C, so the guarantee is shifted to the next recipe cycle.%nIf parallels are > 1, pity doesn't apply.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.lBuQcNYjQ8-YsMFqW6U1tQ.name=§c§l§nStoring Computation in the Cloud
betterquesting.quest.lBuQcNYjQ8-YsMFqW6U1tQ.desc=Wireless Computation is similar to Wireless Data, Cloud Computation Server Hatches send computation to Cloud Computation Client Hatches, which other multiblocks can use.%n%nPlace down a Server Hatch on a Quantum Computer, screwdriver the controller to enable Wireless Mode, then after placing down a Client Hatch, you have to set how much computation it should request from the Server Hatch.%n%n[note]These Cloud Computation Hatches are N:M (Many:Many)[/note]
betterquesting.quest.lU1caedNR6G6fdJqbivacw.name=§c§l§nT8: Tipler
betterquesting.quest.lU1caedNR6G6fdJqbivacw.desc=The §4Tipler§r Spacetime Compression Field Generator allows for up to §lT8§r recipes which produce §l4608L§r of Universium per successful batch.%n%nThe §4Tipler§r Time Dilation Field Generator grants a §299.21875%%§r time reduction for any recipe ran in the EoH, but reduces the likelihood of success by §c64.75%%§r.%n%nThe §4Tipler§r Stabilisation Field Generator will boost the success chance of the EoH by §235%%§r, but will decrease the yield by §c35%%§r and increase the power cost by §c5%%§r.
betterquesting.quest.o8_pX-OSRJKBGzDsGujvNw.desc=A helper material needed in some UMV and UXV components. Have fun making millions.%n%n[note]This is extremely slow to make and to process.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.rdzpjzaCS2epgavzZr6L9A.name=§c§l§nUMV Field Generator
betterquesting.quest.rdzpjzaCS2epgavzZr6L9A.desc=Another Field Generator... you are almost done.
betterquesting.quest.sKLPeimGTFS6_hIyc-SOXA.name=§c§l§nUMV Superconductors
betterquesting.quest.sKLPeimGTFS6_hIyc-SOXA.desc=One of the last wires you have to make for now.%n%n[note]Hope you're not using these for hooking up power to your pre-existing machines. Consider the Infinity Wire.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.teFEMExsSEWHYV79M8gpHw.name=§c§l§nRefined Components
betterquesting.quest.teFEMExsSEWHYV79M8gpHw.desc=Reinforced Components can only take your EoH so far. Another upgrade is needed to assemble its stronger parts.%n%nBy incorporating Black Dwarf Matter into their structure, Refined Components remain stable beneath even greater spacetime distortions.
betterquesting.quest.u-2IsyxKTLiZuTY417qWKw.name=§c§l§nTier 4 QFT Catalysts
betterquesting.quest.u-2IsyxKTLiZuTY417qWKw.desc=With Shirabon now acquired, you can finally create catalysts to use in your Tier 4 QFT.%n%n[note]These are extremely expensive, you may want to look into DTPF convergence, and faster means of creating Metastable Oganesson before you can make many of these.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.uXczmEsfT2uRCSnx8Vm4RQ.name=§c§l§nRaw Stellar Plasma
betterquesting.quest.uXczmEsfT2uRCSnx8Vm4RQ.desc=Created by all tiers of the Eye of Harmony, Raw Stellar Plasma can be used for several things including Stellar Catalyst.%n%n[note]You may want to be careful with this material, as later running EOHs with Astral Arrays requires this instead of Hydrogen and Helium, so make sure to never fully run out![/note]
betterquesting.quest.v5GltE2BTW-Me_rEqy5uFg.name=§c§l§nAre you Ready?
betterquesting.quest.v5GltE2BTW-Me_rEqy5uFg.desc=From now on, you'll be dealing with extremely slow recipes.%n%nConsider finishing up your QFTs and upgrading or replacing your old infrastructure to save on TPS.%n%nYou should definitely upgrade your power generation and infrastructure to handle millions of recipes.%n%nThe Eye of Harmony will be consuming most of your power before it starts generating more than it uses.%n%nMay Colen have mercy on your soul.%n%n[note]Welcome to the waiting lounge.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.va9yzhTSSUWxgareXVIaXQ.name=§c§l§nT5: Superb
betterquesting.quest.va9yzhTSSUWxgareXVIaXQ.desc=The §aSuperb§r Spacetime Compression Field Generator allows for up to §lT5§r recipes which produce §l4608L§r of Black Dwarf Matter per successful batch.%n%nThe §aSuperb§r Time Dilation Field Generator grants a §293.75%%§r time reduction for any recipe ran in the EoH, but reduces the likelihood of success by §c37%%§r.%n%nThe §aSuperb§r Stabilisation Field Generator will boost the success chance of the EoH by §220%%§r, but will decrease the yield by §c20%%§r and increase the power cost by §c20%%§r.
betterquesting.quest.wGq5FvuuROyyMPbT_SkMYg.desc=Definitely consider this for the improved Magnetohydrodynamically Constrained Star Matter recipe. You'll also need it to make MHDCSM parts.%n%nKickstarting the loop is expensive and RNG-based. You need 20,736 L of Universium for the first 5 attempts and a catalyst.%n%nThe QFT recipe has a 25%% chance of yielding Eternity per attempt. You should probably boost the QFT with plasmas and focus on producing Eternity.%n%n[note]Did you know the QFT has a fluid mode? It could be useful for extracting molten Shirabon. Just right-click the controller with a §ascrewdriver§r.[/note]%n%n[note]Building a full beacon out of Eternity Blocks might be a bit extravagant, don't you think?[/note]
betterquesting.quest.2QVk9gqBSWKWZQ2T0rXh8A.name=§c§l§n§4§l§nA Universe In Your Drives
betterquesting.quest.2QVk9gqBSWKWZQ2T0rXh8A.desc=AE storage has finally caught up with the materials you are throwing at it. These cells are much more practical than their cheaper single item or single fluid counterparts, though they are also much more expensive.%n%n[note]You will need them for upcoming crafts, too![/note]
betterquesting.quest.2rrP1wt_Qt2LlOqDppdjLQ.name=§4§l§nMAX Circuits
betterquesting.quest.2rrP1wt_Qt2LlOqDppdjLQ.desc=Planck-Scale Circuits, the final circuits in the pack... for now. These MAX circuits are needed for high end UXV parts and the Stargate.%n%n[note]You will need your Quantum NAC to get started%n%nDid you know that Planck-Scale Manifolds, despite being classified as a circuit internally, do not contribute to the calibration of a Special NAC. Planck-Scale Circuits do, however.[/note]%n%n[warn]Whoever told you these rumors is lying to you, these circuits will NEVER be removed... or will they?[/warn]
betterquesting.quest.3jUq4tkmRty9x5vvnqtD9w.name=§4§l§nStrings Upon Strings Upon Strings Upon-
betterquesting.quest.3jUq4tkmRty9x5vvnqtD9w.desc=Computation has gone too far! We've gone too small! Why does it look so cool! These Planck-Scale Manifolds are incomprehensible to the human mind!%nGood thing we have GREGOS to comprehend them for us!%n%n[note]Planck-Scale Manifolds are manufactured in the NAC, and act as circuits.[/note]%n%n[warn]Do not put these in your mouth.[/warn]
betterquesting.quest.7wI7VuLKRe6lqAJpuYKKJg.name=§4§l§nTier 13 (UXV)
betterquesting.quest.7wI7VuLKRe6lqAJpuYKKJg.desc=Welcome to the final tier of NH (for now).%n%nWe hope you enjoy your stay, though be prepared for a lot of waiting.%n%nNow that you have a reliable way to make MHDCSM, it would be wise to upgrade your EOHs to T9 for the Universium boost.%n%nHave fun crafting the Stargate!%n%n[warn]This tier is far from complete. Expect changes.[/warn]
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKDA.name=§6§l§nThe Door to Heaven?
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKDA.desc=You'll need a lot of these to make a full stargate...
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKDQ.name=§6§l§nStargate Ring Block
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKDQ.desc=You'll need 8 of these to construct a full stargate.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKDg.name=§6§l§nStargate Base
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKDg.desc=We need one of these to form the base of the stargate.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKDw.name=§6§l§nStargate Chevron Block
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKDw.desc=You'll need 7 of these to construct a full stargate.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKEA.name=§6§l§nStargate Chevron
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKEA.desc=This is required in order to make the stargate work between dimensions, provided you get a second stargate to dial...
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKIg.name=§6§l§nYou'll Only Need a Few of These
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKIg.desc=It may not actually store any energy, but you still need to make them, okay?
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKJQ.name=§6§l§nStargate Command
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKJQ.desc=Okay so if you actually want to use the stargate you'll need these to power it and dial it up.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKJg.desc=Congratulations, with this final quest, you'll have beaten the hardest challenge in GregTech: New Horizons yet! %n%nThe whole GT:NH Team thanks you for your time spent on this modpack. You are now part of the top 0.5%% of our community!%n%nNow that you made one gate, take this second gate and link them together! (Unless you want to craft the second yourself of course).%n%nDon't hesitate to share your base in #screenshot-brag channel of our Discord server, claim your stargate role, and if you have any feedback on the endgame progression, we will gladly appreciate it!%n%nI guess now it's time for you to go outside, touch grass, or... continue onwards?
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM4A.name=§4§l§nYou Made It!
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM4A.desc=May Dreammaster have mercy on your soul. You have reached the highest craftable tier in the game!
betterquesting.quest.DGfri1njSxOeS79XXo4NIg.name=§4§l§nUXV Energy Hatch
betterquesting.quest.DGfri1njSxOeS79XXo4NIg.desc=The final energy hatch. You should make these wireless as soon as possible.
betterquesting.quest.IGVryoMbRu28q08v4uwSuw.name=§4§l§nFabricating Solar Systems... in Parallel
betterquesting.quest.IGVryoMbRu28q08v4uwSuw.desc=As you've noticed, UXV components are extremely expensive compared to the amount of Universium you can currently produce.%n%nThe Astral Array Fabricator allows you to run EOH recipes in parallel. You can review the math in the second page of the tooltip.%n%nFor a direct answer, you can use this spreadsheet: [url]https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1FTFdfmY_UWbTbFOyNzARKeI90pbHvPBH6M3JHJmaC-E/edit?usp=sharing[/url]%n%n[warn]Be aware that the EOH will use Raw Stellar Plasma instead of Hydrogen and Helium if you use Astral Arrays.[/warn]%n%n[note]Make sure you are generating enough power.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.KNM9ICNAQIa8NaFoXwCC9g.name=§6§l§nSee You Next Time!
betterquesting.quest.KNM9ICNAQIa8NaFoXwCC9g.desc=Still want more? Consider doing another run! Maybe even with some restrictions if you want to spice it up a bit. Check the first quest chapter for some recommendations!%n%nThere's also roles to be earned for completing the pack two or even three times if you want an extra incentive.%n%n[note]This quest and “The Factory Must Grow!” are mutually exclusive; completing one will lock the other.%n%nIf you are going for 100%% questbook completion, don't panic, finishing either quest still allows the tab to receive a green check (much like the previous XOR quests).[/note]
betterquesting.quest.Ni-YWTVjSz6Bk_MeC0hIiQ.name=§4§l§nIt Gets to a Point
betterquesting.quest.Ni-YWTVjSz6Bk_MeC0hIiQ.desc=You are not done with wafers. Ok well, now you are, kind of.%n%nInfinite Wafers are the final tier of raw wafer, forged directly in the God Forge. Who knew silicon could hold up for this long?%n%nYocto Power ICs are used in Magmatter Nanites, MAX circuits, and UXV Energy Hatches.%n%n[note]You'll need a UXV Laser Engraver to cut these.%n%nYocto Power ICs need to be coated in Quark Gluon Plasma in an Exo-Foundry, overclocked to reach the MAX voltage required. This step cannot be done in a Mass Solidifier.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.OCv5OWo6Q9KDfqe1w0ET9w.name=§6§l§nThe Factory Must Grow!
betterquesting.quest.OCv5OWo6Q9KDfqe1w0ET9w.desc=A single stargate pair wasn't enough for you?%n%nWell then, time to build a network.%n%nWelcome to the post-stargate tier! %n%nNow that you successfully managed to make a stargate, what about crafting them in industrial quantities? Try to craft 5 pairs of gates in the least amount of time, then come in #screenshot-brag and post your time to see where your infrastructure stands in the community!%n%n[note]This quest and “See You Next Time!” are mutually exclusive; completing one will lock the other.%n%nIf you are going for 100%% questbook completion, don't panic, finishing either quest still allows the tab to receive a green check (much like the previous XOR quests).[/note]%n%n§dEnjoy your round of Minesweeper!
betterquesting.quest.UVG21mYSQJex90gQWdkpIw.name=§4§l§nAssembling on Space Steroids
betterquesting.quest.UVG21mYSQJex90gQWdkpIw.desc=Has 64 parallels and consumes ~30b EU/t per module, expensive to run but absolutely worth it.
betterquesting.quest.Uj0PvsNCQw-aWaEOvlFpow.name=§4§l§nHumongous Hatch
betterquesting.quest.Uj0PvsNCQw-aWaEOvlFpow.desc=At last... salvation from the egregious EoH hatch input limitations!%n%nThis will reduce the waiting time between cycles to a fraction of what it was before. 
betterquesting.quest.W5cccuPzQGqJzhYW_kBMcQ.name=§6§l§nMaybe Change Your Mind
betterquesting.quest.W5cccuPzQGqJzhYW_kBMcQ.desc=Has gem progression gone too far?
betterquesting.quest.bHFEDKAiTwGxaiyZEsmdjg.name=§4§l§nRule of Threes
betterquesting.quest.bHFEDKAiTwGxaiyZEsmdjg.desc=The final external structural upgrade to the Forge requires the most advanced understanding of graviton shards and their applications in extreme environments. With this, the last 4 module slots of the Forge of the Gods are available to construct, ascending your operation to unseen heights of technological mastery.%n%n[note]Adding a third and final ring to your Godforge allows for 4 additional modules, as well as allowing you to pick all three paths in the split paths part of the upgrade tree, allowing for a fully upgraded Godforge.[/note]%n%n[note]Usage of a third ring requires the END upgrade.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.fTEQD_w8TTerm_ETSVcBmA.name=§6§l§nStargate Frame Part
betterquesting.quest.fTEQD_w8TTerm_ETSVcBmA.desc=The framework of the Stargate. You wouldn't want it held together with glue, would you?%n%nRight, maybe you would...
betterquesting.quest.hNdNrT_aSKaYi_TnT7cowA.name=§4§l§nSimulating a Solar System
betterquesting.quest.hNdNrT_aSKaYi_TnT7cowA.desc=Almost as expensive as the real one, right? Not to worry, this stargate and the current are only just the beginning.%n%n[note]Our journey reaches the current end, entering the UXV, aka EOH era.%n%nThe year is 2023, and the game continues to be pushed further and further. The EOH exists now, along with machine parts up to UXV. Multiblocks have gained endless amounts of quality of life, including sub 1-tick OC, batch mode, void protection, and numerous AE2 additions like Crafting Input Buses, Stocking Hatches, Level Maintainers and more. Automation has never been easier, yet the goal has never been placed farther. Naquadah Fuel now has many tiers and can compete into the late-game, even competing with (now fixed) Dyson, but outclassed by the huge amount of power a maximized EOH can make (12.8 TEU/t!).%n%nInitially the stargate recipe seemed impossible, requiring months of runtime on hundreds of maximized EOHs, requiring some adjustments to be more realistic to attain. After this was changed, the race began again, this time between §aJohny709§r and §aGDCloud§r. §aJohny§r burned out towards the end, and §aGDCloud§r was surpassed by a silent contender, §aStarStack§r, being the first to conquer this challenge on the §a26th of June, 2023§r.%n%nBeyond just the first, this era marked the beginning of the Group Run Era, with large runs such as §aBallers Run§r (setting this era into motion), §aBee Run§r (affecting wide change on the NH project and its management as a whole), and §aCell Run 2§r (the fastest ever Stargate run at the time, only 73 days, popularizing many automation techniques like Level Maintained lines).%n%nAdditionally, this version saw the first player achieve GTNH Gods, reaching Stargate in a 3rd run, earned by §aGDCloud§r as a part of §aCell Run 2§r on the §a23rd of June, 2024§r. Later this Stargate would see three others reach this goal, §aRamspace§r on the §a29th of September, 2024§r, and §aStaffiX§r and §aserenibyss§r in a group run on the §a17th of November, 2024§r.%n%nP.S.: Here's the list as usual:%n-Many new processing multiblocks like HILE, Fluid Shaper, Industrial Autoclave, etc.%n-Forge of the Gods, Black Hole Compressor, Antimatter power generation, Precise Assembler T4%n-DTPF Convergence, Component Assembly Line tiered bonuses, Mega Vac Subspace Cooling, MK5 fusion skips for Metastable Oganesson%n-Wireless Data Hatches, Wireless Optical Hatches, Uncertainty Resolution%n-Artificial Universe Cells, smart blocking mode[/note]
betterquesting.quest.iLn_-6-LSk-wEOfi9muW3w.name=§4§l§nT3 Exo-Foundry
betterquesting.quest.iLn_-6-LSk-wEOfi9muW3w.desc=Now that you have your hands on Eternity you can upgrade your §nExo-Foundry§r to the final tier!%n%nThe §6§lCelestial Magnetic Chassis§r will allow your Foundry to have a maximum of four modules installed, unlocking the most powerful combinations.%n%n[note]Checkout the Wiki if you need ideas on which modules to choose [url]https://wiki.gtnewhorizons.com/wiki/Exo-Foundry[/url][/note]
betterquesting.quest.itcSYyc3Tdq9Q1qrP5RoEg.name=§4§l§nA Minor Roadblock
betterquesting.quest.itcSYyc3Tdq9Q1qrP5RoEg.desc=MAX circuits huh... Is it really almost over?
betterquesting.quest.iu0rzCLcR_K7Oc2EDtQqgg.name=§6§l§nUNLIMITED COMPUTATION
betterquesting.quest.iu0rzCLcR_K7Oc2EDtQqgg.desc=So many circuits. Maybe that Assembly Complex should have stayed in the drafts...
betterquesting.quest.smCKxKkMSeyIAUeFInS4hQ.name=§4§l§nYour Lord and Savior, UXV CoAL
betterquesting.quest.smCKxKkMSeyIAUeFInS4hQ.desc=You want to rush this as soon as possible.%n%nEvery L of Universium matters.
betterquesting.quest.ztV-j35XSXaQ0OQ1TSyKew.name=§4§l§nAn Offering To The Gods
betterquesting.quest.ztV-j35XSXaQ0OQ1TSyKew.desc=Another Stargate recipe, another trophy. You know the drill by now: submit two legacy Stargates' worth of materials and receive one cute little trophy. %n%n[note]Our journey reaches its latest stop, entering the era of refinement.%n%nThe year is 2025, and the game has become more refined than ever before. So refined, in fact, that we may have added a little too much quality of life and accidentally earned this Stargate the nickname "EZ Gate." Easy is relative, of course; it was still a Stargate, after all.%n%nThe Matter Manipulator has transformed base building and infrastructure expansion, allowing entire structures to be planned, copied, and moved, while NEI autocrafting has made early progression considerably faster. Et Futurum Requiem has brought Netherite and Prismarine to the pack alongside their new processing lines. At the end of progression, the T4 Nano Forge has provided a much-needed alternative to endless T3 spam, while the EoH pity system has made its worst streaks of RNG more manageable.%n%nAutomation has continued to improve, and years of accumulated knowledge have transformed problems that once took entire teams months to solve into well-understood production challenges. Outside the pack, the community has created countless calculators, planners, visualizers, and specialized programs for automation, base design, optimization, or simply for fun.%n%nThe results have been difficult to ignore. More Stargates have been completed during this period than in any previous era, with the recorded gate count on Discord passing 1,000 before the release of 2.9.%n%nA team composed of some of the pack's most talented and experienced players completed a full Stargate run in only 22 days, 16 hours, and 45 minutes on January 26, 2026, setting a new speedrun record. §aPxx500§r and §aAdam§r achieved the first documented "Gatelympics Games Champion" (quintuple) gate during that very same speedrun.%n%nNot that either of those records lasted very long! The speedrunners came back for more, completing another full run on October 5, 2026, in a mere 17 days, 15 hours, and 28 minutes. One day later, the separate TeuTeuLand run was completed, earning §aAdam§r the world's very first "Professional Grass Toucher" (sextuple) gate!%n%nOn the solo end of things, the very first singleplayer GTNH: Gods (triple) gate was achieved by §aSintken§r on July 2, 2025, and the second was achieved shortly after by §aLordPeverell§r on July 24, 2025.%n%nP.S.: Here's the list as usual:%n-Matter Manipulator%n-Spinmatron%n-Large Hadron Collider%n-LATEX%n-Nanochip Assembly Complex%n-Bose-Einstein Condensate Line%n-Exo-Foundry%n-Solar Factory%n-Nano Forge T4%n-EoH pity system%n-Super Stock Replenisher[/note]%n%n§2P.S. In case you were wondering, 2.7 was the last version where you needed to craft two Stargates in order to qualify for a completed run. This requirement was brought down to one Stargate in 2.8, but for the purposes of this quest, you will be making the equivalent of two, since the recipe didn't change between versions. %n%nSorry, Questmasters :P§r
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF0A.desc=In the last step you need to infuse your Marshmallow with some epic food in the Thaumcraft infusion altar. Before you can do it you need to unlock the research.%n%nIs this worth it? Is there any enemy worthy of using the buffs this gives on? That's up to you.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFyw.desc=You've heard about Dezil's Marshmallow, a really OP food which can be found from time to time in chests. What about I show you a way to cook this stuff yourself?%n%nAfter you've mastered the flowing spirit in the dream dimension (witchery), put a bit of flour, sugar, salis mundus and draconium dust in your IV Mixer.%nThe recipe starts when you give flowing spirit to it and gives you malformed slush, a very stinky and disgusting piece of...something.%n%nBe careful, you'll get blindness II when holding it in your hand.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFzA.desc=Next step is to form this slush into the right shape. Use a Marshmallow Mold and press it with your IV forming press. Remember to sterilize it after using it.%n%nBe careful, you'll get blindness and hunger II holding it.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFzg.desc=Next step is heating up your Marshmallow in an Electric Blast Furnace at 4500K with some noble gas and making it glow.%n%nNow you'll get a Paralysis II effect in addition to the others.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFzw.desc=In the next step you cool your Glowing Marshmallow in an EV Vacuum Freezer to make it more stable.%n%nYou still get Weakness II and Nausea II.
betterquesting.quest.ogXyVJTpQ8ONbZthhrupqg.name=A Magical Lunchbox?
betterquesting.quest.ogXyVJTpQ8ONbZthhrupqg.desc=Given sufficient magical prowess, the Thaumaturgist need not waste their time physically consuming food. The Talisman of Nourishment can hold up to 1000 hunger and 1000 saturation points, and will feed you automatically. %n%nYou can fill it up by placing food items on your hotbar, the more valuable the food, the more points added.%n%n[note]Careful not to place food items you want to keep in your hotbar while you have it on you![/note]
betterquesting.quest.uPmgcTcIR6OcAYqLCD7IkQ.name=Ice Ice Baby
betterquesting.quest.uPmgcTcIR6OcAYqLCD7IkQ.desc=GregTech now makes &z&qice creams§r. Yes, really.%n%nSomewhere out there is a machine that turns... something... into ice cream. Lots of flavors. Some good, some weird, some questionable.%n%nGo find it and see what you get.
betterquesting.questline.GbGDSZsbQUekpRKT9ZPdjw.desc=And remember crawlers: Kill, Kill, Kill! But only plants.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGBw.name=Weed-EX
betterquesting.quest.ExzkZigMSNafnvdI-5apjg.desc=A source of platinum.%n%nPlatina leaves will 4x your plat line ores.%n%n[note]Using Platina will create a surplus of Aqua Regia if you just use it in your existing plat line, you'll need some extra infrastructure to handle the excess.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.-MexGhcYQ0OUrr5xgriDXQ.name=Indestructible Vessel
betterquesting.quest.-MexGhcYQ0OUrr5xgriDXQ.desc=In light of your thaumaturgical research, you have come to the conclusion that Greatwood is, in fact, a great material for constructing a resilient boat. Utilizing this material to its fullest potential has allowed you to construct a boat that is slightly faster and will never break on collision.
betterquesting.quest.8QSORTVOSOaUXC6mQurMgA.name=Relocator
betterquesting.quest.8QSORTVOSOaUXC6mQurMgA.desc=The relocator allows for teleportation to previously marked locations, even between dimensions.%n%n[note]Uses quite a lot of power so a GraviChestPlate or other energy sources are recommended.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACjQ.name=Advanced Electric Jetpack
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACjQ.desc=The advanced electric jetpack is an upgraded version of the electric jetpack.%nWhile worn in the chest armor slot and charged with EU, it allows the player to fly. It provides no armor protection, but will charge tools being used in the same manner as the advanced lappack from its 3,000,000 EU internal storage.%n%nThe advanced electric jetpack is limited to a maximum flying height of Y-256.%n%n[note]To turn it on, hit the fly key listed under gravisuite. You can then use space to fly up. To activate hover, hit the IC2 mode key while holding space. Will also recharge tools.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF5Q.name=Travelocity!
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF5Q.desc=A staff of traveling can get you really moving around your base. Hold shift and right-click to teleport in that direction. If you've got travel anchors, just right-clicking will send you to them. The range is 16 blocks for normal TP, 128 to an anchor.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFQA.name=Angel Wings
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFQA.desc=Since you have access to better materials than cardboard now, you wanted to make wings. Angel wings.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFQQ.name=Secret-Angel-Assassin
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFQQ.desc=Infusing your Wings with nano technology seems to be the next step, to further improve them and combine magic and technology.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFSw.name=Angel Wings - Ultra Force!
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFSw.desc=From ore to ingot, from nano to quantum, as you progress, your technology level increases, so should your wings as well.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI1A.name=Better Boots with a little pizzazz
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI1A.desc=Electric Boots of the Traveller grant you a 2%% Vis Discount along with all the benefits of the regular Boots of the Traveller.%n%nIn addition, they come with a wide variety of new features thanks to our amazing magic devs:%n%n- Configurable Jump Boost: You can choose between 0%%, 25%%, 50%%, 75%%, or a 100%% jump boost.%n%n- Configurable Speed Boost: Similar to the jump boost, you can adjust the speed boost percentage to your preference.%n%n- Flight Inertia: When toggled on, this feature cancels inertia while flying, allowing for precise movement even when traveling at high speeds.%n%n- Omnidirectional Movement: This toggle lets you decide whether your speed boost applies in all directions or only while running straight ahead.%n%n[note]None of these keybinds are set by default. The easiest way to configure them is to go into Options -> Controls, turn on the "Category" button, and type "Thaumic Boots." Then, assign keys for the features as needed.[/note]%n%n[note]If you want to advance in the dark arts you can also make them voidwalker boots.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI1Q.name=Walk all over you
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI1Q.desc=Nanosuit Boots of the Traveller provide all the benefits of the Nanosuit, plus a massive speed boost, higher jump, and improved Vis Discount. These are the perfect boots for the master magical engineer.%n%n[note]If you want to advance in the dark arts you can also make them voidwalker boots.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI1g.name=Walking across the stars
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI1g.desc=Quantum Boots of the Traveller, for when you really need to run as fast as the wind. Might cause you some problems standing still!%n%n[note]If you want to advance in the dark arts you can also make them voidwalker boots.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDA.name=Flying Like....Mary Poppins?
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDA.desc=The Thaumostatic Harness grants you flight, using up Potentia from a jar. The speed isn't great though, so perhaps further research will yield some results.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDQ.name=Flying With the Greatest of Ease
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDQ.desc=Ahh, that's better. With this girdle you can really fly around like a true wizard. It does take a little extra potentia to use though, so keep an eye on your flying time.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDg.name=Working While Flying?
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDg.desc=With these devices you can now fly and work at the same time without penalty. They can be found in the Witching Gadgets tab of the book. You'll need a Swiftness potion for this device.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDw.name=Long Distance Power Delivery
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDw.desc=No mage wants to be restricted to short flying times. With this spire from the Automagy discipline you can transmit magical energy directly to your flying harness. To get the correct Thaumium block, compress 9 ingots to get the GT Thaumium block and then chisel that block to get the correct type.%n%nThis multiblock requires centi-vis to operate. You can use 2-6 Thaumostatic Pylons, with additional pylons extending the range. Provide the construct Aer centi-vis to operate, and it will accept Potentia essentia to transfer to flyers. The construct will also accept Aer and Volatus essentia to increase the range and rate of transfer, respectively. Right-click the sides of the controller to control which type of essentia each side will accept.
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIEg.name=Flying Like a Eag - I Mean Raven
betterquesting.quest.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIEg.desc=This cloak is a nice substitute for the Glider. There are plenty of other magical items worth a look in the Witching Gadgets tab.%n%nIf you want to toggle gliding with a key, configure the binding for "Hotkey for activating some worn items" in the control settings.%n%n[warn]Not recommended for use on a Space Station![/warn]
